  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Service Delivery- Private- Marie Stopes International (MSI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The private sector is a key provider of family planning and other health services for the poor.  This component works with private sector partners to improve the coverage and quality of goods and services they offer through social marketing, social franchising and mobile outreach approaches. Social marketing promotes the sale of branded contraceptives through retail outlets such as shops (condoms) and pharmacies (condoms, pills, injectables, emergency contraception).  Social franchising enlists private clinics into a branded FP network to provide quality assured FP services. Mobile outreach delivers FP to unserved remote population groups. Implementing Partner: Marie Stopes International</narrative>
  </description>
